1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
EvidenceWeave：本地证据交叉核验工作台
EvidenceWeave — Local evidence cross-verification for legal teams

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
演示直接打开已完成分析的虚构案件，跳过十几分钟的模型处理过程。
We start from a completed fictional case and skip the lengthy model-processing stage.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:32,000
11 份卷宗、24 条相关原子事实、34 处潜在矛盾；数据与模型均留在本机。
11 records, 24 relevant atomic facts, and 34 potential conflicts — all processed locally.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:50,000
一致性矩阵把供述、证言、监控和网约车记录按同一待证问题并排对照。
The matrix aligns statements, testimony, surveillance, and ride records by the same issue.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:10,000
每条 AI 提示都展示双方原文、来源、页码与判断理由，并明确置信度不是事实概率。
Every AI flag shows both quotes, sources, pages, and rationale; confidence is not truth probability.

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:27,000
点击来源即可跳回 PDF 引用页，并高亮对应原文块：No Citation, No Claim。
One click returns to the cited PDF page and highlights the exact source block.

7
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:43,000
律师复核独立保存。本例已确认矛盾并记录备注，AI 判断不会覆盖人工结论。
Attorney review is stored separately; the confirmed decision and note remain independent of AI.

8
00:01:43,000 --> 00:02:01,000
供述变化按材料日期展开，直观看到从否认进入到承认到场、收款的变化轨迹。
The timeline reveals how statements evolve from denial to admission and changed payment details.

9
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:16,000
原始卷宗始终保留在案件中，解析状态、材料类型与来源信息均可回查。
Original records stay attached to the case with traceable parsing status and source metadata.

10
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:26,000
EvidenceWeave 只负责发现值得核验的关系，最终判断始终由律师作出。
EvidenceWeave flags what deserves review; lawyers always make the final decision.

11
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:34,000
No Citation, No Claim. · AI flags. Lawyers decide.
Local-first · Source-grounded · Human-reviewed
